00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:17.680
e4 e5 knight f3 knight c6 bishop c4 now play&nbsp;
knight d4 if white is greedy and plays e5&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:26.480
go queen g5 white continues the greed and&nbsp;
captures the pawn on f7 now take on g2&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.800
white moves the rook to safety queen checks&nbsp;
on e4 white tries to block with the bishop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:40.000
and boom knight f3 checkmate&nbsp;
this is called smothered mate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.080
